WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:05.040
What happens when you introduce a&nbsp;
doll and human tears to SCP-914?

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:09.840
Dr. Einen prepared a container filled with&nbsp;
20mg of tears, and a clay doll resembling a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:14.720
wide-eyed child for experimentation. He placed&nbsp;
both items into the Clockworks on the setting,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:19.200
"Very Fine," and the output produced was an&nbsp;
object with the appearance of the original doll,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:21.200
but the ability to move on its own.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:26.000
When upset, it shot tears from its eyes. The&nbsp;
object was neutralized after being exposed to a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:31.440
small wooden cross, and Dr. Einen was reprimanded&nbsp;
for attempting to make something alive.

